Hi,

inlabru does not currently support the X1:X2 construction (but I’ve been thinking of how to best implement such support in a future version).
What kind of variables are X1 and X2? If they are discrete values with only a small number of levels you could precompute the corresponding model matrix columns and use those as individual covariates instead, for the same result.

Finn

