you can always do that expansion yourself, manually

> data = data.frame(x=1:10,z=as.factor(rep(1:5,each=2)))
> model.matrix( ~ x:z,data=data)
   (Intercept) x:z1 x:z2 x:z3 x:z4 x:z5
1            1    1    0    0    0    0
2            1    2    0    0    0    0
3            1    0    3    0    0    0
4            1    0    4    0    0    0
5            1    0    0    5    0    0
6            1    0    0    6    0    0
7            1    0    0    0    7    0
8            1    0    0    0    8    0
9            1    0    0    0    0    9
10           1    0    0    0    0   10
attr(,"assign")
[1] 0 1 1 1 1 1
attr(,"contrasts")
attr(,"contrasts")$z
[1] "contr.treatment"

