Hi,

I am so sorry if I am asking so many questions, I am really trying to make things work.

First, yes, this model runs nicely with INLA. My formula is :

bym.test <- inla(Y~ X + f(struct, model = "besag", graph = "ADA.coop.train",  scale.model = TRUE, constr = TRUE, hyper = hyper3) + f(unstruct, model = "iid", hyper = hyper3),
                      data = as.data.frame(ADA.train.pol3), family = "poisson", E = tot.offset,

                       control.predictor = list(compute = TRUE, link = 1))

Second, you were right about unstruct being a factor, I changed it to a numeric variable.

